From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hayaksi1 <193020925+hayaksi1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 22:55:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Collect the relocated fork tests and restore the dropped cases

The vitest move left fork tests under apps/web/src with a -test suffix,
which no runner collects, and several merges kept none of the branch's
tests. This patch renames those suites, gives them a DOM and the imports
they need, puts the dropped cases back, opens threads full-size on this
build, gives jump-to-date the room view store, and refreshes the snapshots
the rebuilt styles and the search button moved.

---
diff --git a/apps/desktop/src/auto-launch.test.ts b/apps/desktop/src/auto-launch.test.ts
index e1d13bff2f..c023bb16d3 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/src/auto-launch.test.ts
+++ b/apps/desktop/src/auto-launch.test.ts
@@ -109,9 +109,7 @@ describe("AutoLaunch", () => {
